*lutime* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''lutime(path, atime, mtime)''

Sets the ''a''ccess and ''m''odification ''time''stamps of the symbolic link at ''path'', without following it.

*Parameters:*
- ''path'': String path to the symbolic link
- ''atime'': Number Unix timestamp of last access time
- ''mtime'': Number Unix timestamp of last modification time

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure
